3ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清河茂才以良笔并诗为惠次韵奉答","author":"林逋","text":"郊翰秋劲愈于锥，筠管温温上玉辉。\n聊为夫君一栖阁，老来驽缓久知非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28870,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"猫儿","author":"林逋","text":"纤钩时得小溪鱼，饱卧花阴兴有馀。\n自是鼠嫌贫不到，莫惭尸素在吾庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28871,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"菱塘","author":"林逋","text":"含机绿锦翻新叶，满匣青铜瑩古花。\n最爱晚来鸥与鹭，宿烟翘雨便为家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28872,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答谢尉得替","author":"林逋","text":"牢愁漫散空阶雨，羁宦閒伤落日春。\n未似青青河畔草，客亭长短送离人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28873,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答潘司理","author":"林逋","text":"庭柯雪压已如春，乘兴山阴亦少人。\n岑寂园庐何所对，酒中贤圣药君臣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28874,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"葑田","author":"林逋","text":"淤泥肥黑稻秧青，阔盖深流旋旋生。\n拟倩湖君书版籍，水仙今佃老农耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28875,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"槐木纸椎","author":"林逋","text":"入手轻乾是古槐，几声清响彻池台。\n椎馀鱼网如脂滑，时写新诗肯寄来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28876,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"僧有示西湖墨本者就孤山左侧林萝秘邃间状出衡茅之所且题云林山人隐居谨书二韵以承之","author":"林逋","text":"泉石年来偶结庐，冷挨松雪瞰西湖。\n高僧好事仍多艺，已共孤山入画图。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28877,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠中师草圣","author":"林逋","text":"行草得三昧，林间尝与语。\n秋风忽捲衣，别我之何所。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28878,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又咏小梅","author":"林逋","text":"数年闲作园林主，未有新诗到小梅。\n摘索又开三两朵，团栾空绕百千回。\n荒邻独映山初尽，晚景相禁雪欲来。\n寄语清香少愁结，为君吟罢一衔杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":28879,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]